message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FlaskVerseHub: a research-grade Flask reference platform with a reproducible retrieval benchmark"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SatvikPraveen/FlaskVerseHub"
url: "https://github.com/SatvikPraveen/FlaskVerseHub"
authors:
  - family-names: Praveen
    given-names: Satvik
